<p>
  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://hexdocs.pm/gleam_stdlib/gleam/list.html#filter\" target=\"_blank\">
    <code>filter</code>
  </a>
  makes a new list containing only the elements for which a function returns
